# Zimone, Paradox Sculptor: "At the beginning of combat on your turn, put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures you
# control." Bot1 casts an Ornithopter and Zimone (four Moxen) on turn 1 and, as combat begins, chooses both as the two targets (Zimone may
# target herself): each ends with one counter, Zimone a 2/5 and the Ornithopter (0/2) a 1/3.

